    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: \"2025-11-28 08:41\"\nmodified: 2025-08-06T23:12:25-05:00\n---\nIt's a value that it can be obtained from the [[Chemical Table]].\n\nThe molar mass is the mass of a mol of substance. Expressed in grams per mol. $(g/mol)$\n\nNow how you obtained? First from the chemical table you are able to obtain the atomic mass of each atom, then for molecules what you make is just sum, taking in account the number of each atom present in the molecule.\n",
