    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-11-04 14:45\nmodified: 2025-11-06 08:33\n---\nCalled **action expert** used for robotics-specific inputs and outputs. Set of weights.\n\n- For $\\pi_{0}$ 300 M of parameters.\n- Trained using [[Flow matching for VLAs]] because there are a ton of issues.\n- [[Insulating Knowledge]] for not decrease the quality of the [[Vision Language Model VLM]].\n",
