    "id": "250",
    "title": "Architecture Fermi Net",
    "excerpt": "So in order to understand [[Psi Former Ansatz]] you have to understand this so its ansatz its: [^1]",
    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-26 23:42\nmodified: 2025-11-01 15:31\n---\nSo in order to understand [[Psi Former Ansatz]] you have to understand this so its ansatz its: [^1]\n\n$$ \\psi(\\mathbf{x}_{i},\\dots,\\mathbf{x}_{n})=\\sum_{k}\\omega_{k}\\det[\\Phi ^{k}] $$\n\nSo for that you have to understand envelope.\n\nAnd how you compute the [[Orbital for neural network fermi net]].\n\nAnd then understand how that is related with [[Psi Former Ansatz]]\n\n[^1]: [[Ab Initio Solution of the Many Electron Schrodinger Equation with Deep Neural Networks]]\n",
    "uploadDate": "2025-10-26 23:42",
