    "id": "254",
    "title": "Psi Former Ansatz",
    "excerpt": "So our **ansatz** motivaded for the [[Kato Cusp Conditions]] and the [[Fermi Dirac Statistics]] is: [^1]",
    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-26 17:28\nmodified: 2026-01-15 20:23\n---\nSo our **ansatz** motivaded for the [[Kato Cusp Conditions]] and the [[Fermi Dirac Statistics]] is: [^1]\n$$ \\Psi_{\\theta}(\\mathbf{x})=\\exp(\\mathcal{J}_{\\theta}(\\mathbf{x}))\\sum_{k=1}^{N_{\\det}}\\det[\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}_{\\theta}^{k}(x)] $$\n\n- Where the $\\mathcal{J_{\\theta}}$ is the [[Jastrow Factor for Psi Former]] and the other ares [[Slater Determinants for psiformer]]\n\n[[Psi former Attention Mechanism]]\n\n[^1]: [[A self attention ansatz for ab-initio quantum chemistry]]\n",
    "uploadDate": "2025-10-26 17:28",
    "readTime": "2 min read",
    "fileName": "Psi Former Ansatz.md",
    "featured": false
