    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-18 12:29\nmodified: 2025-10-20 18:29\n---\nThe [[Nabla Operator]] is the Spherical System is:\n\n$$\n\\nabla=\\hat{\\mathbf{r}}\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial r}+\\boldsymbol{\\hat{\\theta}}\\frac{1}{r}\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial \\theta}+\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\phi}}\\frac{1}{r\\sin \\theta}\\frac{\\partial }{\\partial \\phi}\n$$\n\nBut what $\\boldsymbol{\\hat{\\theta}}$ means? \n\n\n[[Spherical and Cylindrical Coordinate System]]",
    "uploadDate": "2025-10-18 12:29",
