    "excerpt": "Let's say that you a [[Vector Function]] $g:\\mathbb{R}^{m}\\to \\mathbb{R}^{n}$ and a [[Scalar function]] $f:\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\to \\mathbb{R}$.",
