    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-14 09:29\nmodified: 2025-10-14 09:34\n---\nSo you can define a [[Polynomial]] using it, and then by differentiating or [[Taylor's Polynomial]] obtain properties.\n\nThe most well known cases:\n- [[Bernoulli Polynomial]]\n- [[Hermite polinomials]]\n- [[Legendre Polinomial]]",
