    "id": "334",
    "title": "Broglie'S Relation",
    "excerpt": "So the [[Wave number]] and the [[angular frequency for QM]].",
    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-10 13:06\nmodified: 2025-10-10 13:12\n---\nSo the [[Wave number]] and the [[angular frequency for QM]].\n\nFrom this you have to derivate:\n\n$$ p=\\hbar k $$\n\n$$ E=\\hbar\\omega $$\n\nFrom where this come from.",
