    "excerpt": "The [[Hadamard Gate]] can take the [[Pauli Matrices]] and return also [[Pauli Matrices]].",
    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\ndate: 2025-10-10 08:29\nmodified: 2025-10-10 08:36\n---\nThe [[Hadamard Gate]] can take the [[Pauli Matrices]] and return also [[Pauli Matrices]].\nThis is in a another way a group with [[Pauli Matrix Z]], [[Pauli Matrix Y]] and [[Pauli Matrix X]].\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\nHZH & =X \\\\\nHXH & =Z \\\\\nHYH & =-Y\n\\end{align}\n$$",
