    "content": "---\ntags:\n  - baby\nauthor: Jorge\ndate: 2025-10-01 18:45\nmodified: 2025-10-01 19:49\n---\nIt is important to remark that the [[Eigenvector]] of the [[Pauli Matrices]] are the notable point on the [[Bloch Sphere, what it is]]. The six important point.\n\nThe notation is\n\n$$\n\\ket{x,+}  , \\ket{x,-} , \\ket{y,+} \n$$\n\nA beauty creation is:\n$$ \\sigma_{n}=\\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi \\sigma_{x}+\\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi \\sigma_{y}+\\cos \\theta \\sigma_{z}=\\vec{n}\\cdot \\vec{\\sigma} $$\n\nWonder about the importance of this, if it have any meaning then you understand the reason of the labels.\n\n[[quantum circuits]]",
